{"4695640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STATION 07", "steam_appid": 4695640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Deep Freeze. Reclaim Station 07.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perched above a glacial fissure, Station 07 was once a pinnacle of deep-core research. Then the storm came. Routes vanished. You were abandoned by the surface. Now, you are the last soul at the core, separated from the ruins by a violent meltwater river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold is not your only enemy. Hostile scavengers, resource depletion, and the horrific secrets of human experimentation lurk in the snow. Will you hold your ground, or push into the frozen unknown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>Our game actually supports both first-person and third-person views — you can switch anytime! (And yes… please ignore my terrible aim in first-person lol, I tried my best) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/966a6f7435901d9c410f776e18746e25.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/966a6f7435901d9c410f776e18746e25.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/966a6f7435901d9c410f776e18746e25.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Management:</strong> Restore the derelict Station 07. Manage critical power grids, heating systems, and oxygen to keep the base operational against the encroaching frost.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/e1f3c68f82fb2c4f6520f9abe59f5d3d.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/e1f3c68f82fb2c4f6520f9abe59f5d3d.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/e1f3c68f82fb2c4f6520f9abe59f5d3d.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Survival Mechanics:</strong> Every calorie and watt counts. Scavenge for scrap, hunt for food, or utilize advanced hydroponics to grow crops in a world where the sun never shines.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/ec29d1bc10720f621b9b03db537dd9c8.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/ec29d1bc10720f621b9b03db537dd9c8.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/ec29d1bc10720f621b9b03db537dd9c8.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Freezing Cycles:</strong> Adapt to a shifting environment. Prepare for the &quot;Deep Freeze&quot; periods where outdoor exploration becomes impossible, forcing you to rely on your base's stockpiles and integrity.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/efc165045ec32976ac75471b37773031.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/efc165045ec32976ac75471b37773031.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/efc165045ec32976ac75471b37773031.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Choice &amp; Combat:</strong> Face hostile human factions and &quot;Cold-Adapted&quot; biological monstrosities. Choose your path: stealthily &quot;borrow&quot; supplies from enemy camps, launch full-scale assaults, or negotiate fragile alliances with other major outposts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/348dccca1b54b2dbba96cc9ac810c5ea.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/348dccca1b54b2dbba96cc9ac810c5ea.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/348dccca1b54b2dbba96cc9ac810c5ea.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas:</strong> Uncover the dark truth behind the station’s research. Encounter victims of human experimentation and decide: will you risk your own survival to shut down these atrocities, or turn a blind eye to stay alive?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/54d290d3e0514bc7c8e94bc009b7c5c4.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/54d290d3e0514bc7c8e94bc009b7c5c4.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/54d290d3e0514bc7c8e94bc009b7c5c4.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Modification:</strong> Use your technical expertise to turn industrial scrap into advanced weaponry and survival gear. Modify your equipment to withstand lower temperatures and deadlier foes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/665b74032e987d0185688af307cad070.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/665b74032e987d0185688af307cad070.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/665b74032e987d0185688af307cad070.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Exploration &amp; Vehicle Mastery:</strong> Beyond the walls lies a massive, unforgiving arctic landscape. Deploy specialized vehicles to traverse the tundra, pilot aircraft for aerial reconnaissance, and master water-skimming craft across violent meltwater rivers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/c332e05159d54f5633ca23380f769bcd.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/c332e05159d54f5633ca23380f769bcd.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/c332e05159d54f5633ca23380f769bcd.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>How will you lead? When the world turns to ice, humanity is the first thing to shatter.</strong><br>  <br>  <br><strong>[Developer's Note]:</strong> Our vision for Station 07 is still expanding.<br><br>Wishlist now — it definitely won’t disappoint you.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Deep Freeze. Reclaim Station 07.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perched above a glacial fissure, Station 07 was once a pinnacle of deep-core research. Then the storm came. Routes vanished. You were abandoned by the surface. Now, you are the last soul at the core, separated from the ruins by a violent meltwater river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold is not your only enemy. Hostile scavengers, resource depletion, and the horrific secrets of human experimentation lurk in the snow. Will you hold your ground, or push into the frozen unknown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>Our game actually supports both first-person and third-person views — you can switch anytime! (And yes… please ignore my terrible aim in first-person lol, I tried my best) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/966a6f7435901d9c410f776e18746e25.poster.avif?t=1784025941\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/966a6f7435901d9c410f776e18746e25.webm?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4695640/extras/966a6f7435901d9c410f776e18746e25.mp4?t=1784025941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Management:</strong> Restore the derelict Station 07. Manage critical power grids, heating systems, and oxygen to keep the base operational against the encroaching frost.<br><span class=\"bb_img